  "captions": [
    {"start": 0.401, "end": 3.521, "lines": ["An expectation","of what space flight's going to be like."]},
    {"start": 3.521, "end": 6.721, "lines": ["And I think they're often surprised"]},
    {"start": 6.721, "end": 11.281, "lines": ["that we have such limitations","on the resources that we can take"]},
    {"start": 11.281, "end": 14.401, "lines": ["and the infrastructure that's","there supporting the crew."]},
    {"start": 14.401, "end": 19.521, "lines": ["And so that was the importance of this","mission, was that we know that we're going"]},
    {"start": 19.521, "end": 22.944, "lines": ["to have such limited resources compared","to The International Space"]},
    {"start": 22.944, "end": 25.904, "lines": ["Station, when we go on to the moon","and Mars, that we really"]},
    {"start": 25.904, "end": 28.624, "lines": ["need to understand how we're trading","in that space and"]},
    {"start": 28.624, "end": 32.864, "lines": ["making sure that we're bringing the right","things in that limited resource space."]},
    {"start": 32.864, "end": 34.464, "lines": ["And so,"]},
    {"start": 34.464, "end": 38.944, "lines": ["just the understanding that, you know,","even on some of these upcoming missions,"]},
    {"start": 38.944, "end": 43.984, "lines": ["we don't even have hot water","and we might not be able to heat food,"]},
    {"start": 43.984, "end": 48.024, "lines": ["things like that, are often surprising."]},
    {"start": 49.04, "end": 53.28, "lines": ["That's where we're working with, and we're","trying to say, we have this much mass,"]},
    {"start": 53.28, "end": 57.6, "lines": ["this much power,","this much volume, and we have to"]},
    {"start": 57.6, "end": 62, "lines": ["make reductions from where we are on the","International Space Station. And how do we"]},
    {"start": 62, "end": 63.12, "lines": ["do that and support crew"]},
    {"start": 63.12, "end": 64.32, "lines": ["in the best way possible?"]},
    {"start": 64.32, "end": 68.16, "lines": ["And that's what these missions are about:","it's to make sure that the way we're"]},
    {"start": 68.16, "end": 70.96, "lines": ["planning is going to enable them","to be successful,"]},
    {"start": 70.96, "end": 74.36, "lines": ["to meet their objectives,","to come home safely."]},
    {"start": 75.68, "end": 79.32, "lines": ["do it in a much more","restricted environment."]},
    {"start": 79.76, "end": 83.36, "lines": ["Yeah, absolutely. I know at least","with telling the Artemis II story"]},
    {"start": 83.36, "end": 86.24, "lines": ["and with limitation mass,","you know, constraints"]},
    {"start": 86.24, "end": 90.288, "lines": ["with what you can bring on Orion versus","Just having at your fingertips"]},
    {"start": 90.288, "end": 94.208, "lines": ["on the International Space Station","is quite different. So, trying"]},
    {"start": 94.208, "end": 95.968, "lines": ["to explain that too. And, you know,"]},
    {"start": 95.968, "end": 100.688, "lines": ["it's funny that you mentioned space movies","because last night at the Artemis II crew,"]},
    {"start": 100.688, "end": 105.488, "lines": ["their final post-flight event here","in Houston, one of the questions"]},
    {"start": 105.488, "end": 110.448, "lines": ["from the audience was: What is something","in space movies that you wish"]},
    {"start": 110.448, "end": 114.288, "lines": ["they shared more about when it comes","to difficulties of space flight?"]},
    {"start": 114.288, "end": 118.088, "lines": ["They definitely mentioned constraints","with size, weight, just"]},
    {"start": 118.416, "end": 120.416, "lines": ["Items at your luxury,"]},
    {"start": 120.416, "end": 124.416, "lines": ["but also showing, not showing,","but talking about going to the bathroom,"]},
    {"start": 124.416, "end": 129.376, "lines": ["things that are harder that they don't","show in the space movies. We talked"]},
    {"start": 129.376, "end": 133.776, "lines": ["about this just as you were walking","over here to the studio, but reflecting"]},
    {"start": 133.776, "end": 135.136, "lines": ["on the past year,"]},
